Package: rosoyster
Title: Restore Our Shores Oyster Reef Monitoring
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Restore Our Shores", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: A modular Shiny application for oyster reef monitoring, with
    validated field observations, review of finalized data, and one Excel workbook
    per event with consistently named worksheets for each data type.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.8.1), bslib (>= 0.8.0), golem,
    uuid, digest, jsonlite, stats, utils, pkgload, writexl
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.2.0), pkgbuild, renv, rsconnect, withr, htmltools, attachment, readxl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
